THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED. THE LIABILITY OF SIGNALPOST MESSAGING INC. AND OF OMEGA6.0 WASTE
